---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="微风网络帮助中心 | 订阅、Clash、节点与连接问题解决" 
  description="微风网络帮助中心，提供订阅导入、Clash配置、节点连接、网络异常、客户端使用与常见问题解决方法。"
>
  <main class="bg-breeze-dark min-h-screen text-gray-300 pt-24 pb-20 font-sans">
    
    <!-- Hero & 搜索框 -->
    <section class="relative px-4 py-16 text-center overflow-hidden border-b border-white/5 bg-[#0B1628]/50">
      <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[800px] h-[300px] bg-breeze-cyan/10 blur-[120px] pointer-events-none"></div>
      
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto relative z-10">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white mb-6">微风网络帮助中心</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 mb-10">
          遇到连接、订阅、客户端或节点问题？<br class="hidden sm:block"/>搜索问题或从下方分类快速找到排查与解决方法。
        </p>
        
        <div class="relative max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
          <input type="text" id="help-search" placeholder="搜索问题，例如：“订阅更新失败”、“Clash 显示 Timeout”" 
            class="w-full bg-[#131F33] border border-gray-700 text-white px-6 py-5 rounded-2xl pl-14 focus:outline-none focus:border-breeze-cyan focus:ring-1 focus:ring-breeze-cyan transition-all shadow-lg text-lg">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gray-500 absolute left-5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        
        <!-- 6 个快捷分类 -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
          <a href="#cat-connect" class="bg-[#131F33] border border-white/5 hover:border-breeze-cyan/50 text-gray-300 hover:text-white px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl transition-all text-sm font-medium">无法连接</a>
          <a href="#cat-sub" class="bg-[#131F33] border border-white/5 hover:border-breeze-cyan/50 text-gray-300 hover:text-white px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl transition-all text-sm font-medium">订阅问题</a>
          <a href="#cat-clash" class="bg-[#131F33] border border-white/5 hover:border-breeze-cyan/50 text-gray-300 hover:text-white px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl transition-all text-sm font-medium">Clash 问题</a>
          <a href="#cat-node" class="bg-[#131F33] border border-white/5 hover:border-breeze-cyan/50 text-gray-300 hover:text-white px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl transition-all text-sm font-medium">节点问题</a>
          <a href="#cat-account" class="bg-[#131F33] border border-white/5 hover:border-breeze-cyan/50 text-gray-300 hover:text-white px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl transition-all text-sm font-medium">账号 / 套餐</a>
          <a href="/go" rel="nofollow sponsored" target="_blank" class="bg-breeze-cyan/10 border border-breeze-cyan/30 text-breeze-cyan px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl transition-all text-sm font-bold">联系客服</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 互动式问题诊断器 -->
    <section class="py-16 px-4">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-gradient-to-br from-[#131F33] to-[#1a2b47] rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 border border-breeze-cyan/30 shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute -right-20 -top-20 w-64 h-64 bg-breeze-cyan/10 blur-[80px] pointer-events-none"></div>
        
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-8">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-breeze-cyan/20 flex items-center justify-center text-breeze-cyan">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white">智能故障诊断器</h2>
        </div>
        
        <div id="ts-container" class="bg-[#0B1628] rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 border border-white/5 min-h-[200px] flex flex-col justify-center transition-opacity duration-300">
          <h3 id="ts-question" class="text-xl text-white font-medium mb-6 text-center">你遇到了什么问题？</h3>
          <div id="ts-options" class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
            <!-- 动态注入按钮 -->
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 新手快速帮助 -->
    <section class="py-12 px-4 bg-[#0B1628]/50 border-y border-white/5">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-8 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-8 bg-green-500 rounded-full inline-block"></span> 新手快速入门
        </h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
          <a href="/guides" class="bg-[#131F33] p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 hover:border-green-500/50 transition-colors group">
            <h3 class="text-white font-medium mb-1 group-hover:text-green-400 transition-colors">购买后第一步做什么？</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">查看新手整体流程</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/guides" class="bg-[#131F33] p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 hover:border-green-500/50 transition-colors group">
            <h3 class="text-white font-medium mb-1 group-hover:text-green-400 transition-colors">哪里获取订阅链接？</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">官网后台导入指南</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/guides/clash-verge-rev" class="bg-[#131F33] p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 hover:border-green-500/50 transition-colors group">
            <h3 class="text-white font-medium mb-1 group-hover:text-green-400 transition-colors">Windows 怎么用？</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Clash Verge 配置教程</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/guides/subscription-import" class="bg-[#131F33] p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 hover:border-green-500/50 transition-colors group">
            <h3 class="text-white font-medium mb-1 group-hover:text-green-400 transition-colors">iPhone 怎么用？</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Shadowrocket 教程</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 主要分类 FAQ -->
    <section class="py-16 px-4 faq-section" id="faq-wrapper">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-16">
        
        <!-- 连接排查标准流程 -->
        <div id="cat-connect" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-2 h-8 bg-red-500 rounded-full inline-block"></span> 无法连接：标准排查流程
          </h2>
          <div class="bg-[#131F33] p-8 rounded-2xl border border-red-500/20 mb-8">
            <p class="text-gray-400 mb-6">如果你突然无法上网、节点全部变红或打不开网页，请严格按照以下顺序执行：</p>
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-white">
              <div class="bg-red-500/10 text-red-400 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg w-full sm:w-auto text-center border border-red-500/20">1. 更新订阅</div>
              <div class="text-gray-600 hidden sm:block">→</div>
              <div class="bg-red-500/10 text-red-400 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg w-full sm:w-auto text-center border border-red-500/20">2. 切换节点</div>
              <div class="text-gray-600 hidden sm:block">→</div>
              <div class="bg-red-500/10 text-red-400 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg w-full sm:w-auto text-center border border-red-500/20">3. 开启系统代理</div>
              <div class="text-gray-600 hidden sm:block">→</div>
              <div class="bg-red-500/10 text-red-400 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg w-full sm:w-auto text-center border border-red-500/20">4. 重启客户端</div>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-8 text-center text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed border-t border-red-500/10 pt-6">
              如果以上 4 步均无效，通常说明上游机房出现了突发网络波动。<br class="hidden sm:block"/>
              您可以 <a href="/go" rel="nofollow sponsored" target="_blank" class="text-breeze-cyan font-bold hover:underline transition-colors">联系官方客服</a> 反馈，或者耐心稍等十几分钟，技术团队通常已触发告警并正在紧急修复中。<br class="hidden sm:block mt-2"/>
              <span class="text-gray-500 text-xs">您也可以随时前往 <a href="/status" class="text-gray-400 underline hover:text-white transition-colors">服务器状态面板</a> 查看是否有全网中断通告。</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <details class="group bg-[#131F33] rounded-xl border border-white/5 faq-item">
              <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-5 text-gray-200 group-open:text-white transition-colors">
                <span>节点全部 Timeout 怎么办？</span>
                <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180 text-gray-500"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></span>
              </summary>
              <div class="text-gray-400 text-sm p-5 pt-0 leading-relaxed border-t border-white/5 mt-2 faq-answer">
                说明客户端无法与任何服务器建立物理连接。原因通常是：1. 订阅过期，请前往官网确认套餐时间。 2. 你的本地网络（如公司 Wi-Fi 或校园网）屏蔽了翻墙端口，尝试切换手机热点测试。 3. 服务器遭受大面积封锁，请点击更新订阅获取最新接入点。
              </div>
            </details>
            <details class="group bg-[#131F33] rounded-xl border border-white/5 faq-item">
              <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-5 text-gray-200 group-open:text-white transition-colors">
                <span>显示已连接，有绿色数字，但打不开网页？</span>
                <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180 text-gray-500"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></span>
              </summary>
              <div class="text-gray-400 text-sm p-5 pt-0 leading-relaxed border-t border-white/5 mt-2 faq-answer">
                这说明代理通道已经打通，但你的系统流量没有走到客户端里。绝大部分原因是 **系统代理 (System Proxy)** 没有开启，或是被其他浏览器插件（如 SwitchyOmega、去广告插件）冲突拦截了。
              </div>
            </details>
            <details class="group bg-[#131F33] rounded-xl border border-white/5 faq-item">
              <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-5 text-gray-200 group-open:text-white transition-colors">
                <span>手机可以用，但电脑不能用？</span>
                <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180 text-gray-500"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></span>
              </summary>
              <div class="text-gray-400 text-sm p-5 pt-0 leading-relaxed border-t border-white/5 mt-2 faq-answer">
                说明微风网络的节点完全正常。问题出在电脑端的设置上：检查电脑客户端是否处于最新版、系统时间是否与现实时间精准同步（差 1 分钟都会导致加密失败）、以及尝试重启电脑释放被占用的端口。
              </div>
            </details>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 订阅问题 -->
        <div id="cat-sub" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-2 h-8 bg-breeze-cyan rounded-full inline-block"></span> 订阅问题
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <details class="group bg-[#131F33] rounded-xl border border-white/5 faq-item">
              <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-5 text-gray-200 group-open:text-white transition-colors">
                <span>订阅更新失败 / Subscription Failed</span>
                <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180 text-gray-500"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></span>
              </summary>
              <div class="text-gray-400 text-sm p-5 pt-0 leading-relaxed border-t border-white/5 mt-2 faq-answer">
                通常是因为您的本地网络打不开官网后台接口。解决办法：将客户端当前拥有的节点中，随便选中一个可用的，处于“翻墙成功”的状态下，再去点击“更新订阅”，一般都能成功秒更。
              </div>
            </details>
            <details class="group bg-[#131F33] rounded-xl border border-white/5 faq-item">
              <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-5 text-gray-200 group-open:text-white transition-colors">
                <span>订阅链接在哪里？怎么重新导入？</span>
                <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180 text-gray-500"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></span>
              </summary>
              <div class="text-gray-400 text-sm p-5 pt-0 leading-relaxed border-t border-white/5 mt-2 faq-answer">
                请登录微风网络官网用户中心，在首页仪表盘（Dashboard）中寻找“一键订阅”或“复制订阅链接”的按钮。换新设备时，只需在新设备上的客户端里粘贴该链接即可。
              </div>
            </details>
            <details class="group bg-[#131F33] rounded-xl border border-white/5 faq-item">
              <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-5 text-gray-200 group-open:text-white transition-colors">
                <span>订阅链接可以分享给别人吗？</span>
                <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180 text-gray-500"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></span>
              </summary>
              <div class="text-gray-400 text-sm p-5 pt-0 leading-relaxed border-t border-white/5 mt-2 faq-answer">
                强烈不建议。您的订阅链接包含了唯一的 Token。如果系统检测到连接 IP 异常分散、并发数超标，您的账号可能会被风控系统自动封禁。如需多人使用，请让对方单独购买。
              </div>
            </details>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Clash 问题 -->
        <div id="cat-clash" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-2 h-8 bg-blue-500 rounded-full inline-block"></span> Clash / Mihomo 帮助
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <details class="group bg-[#131F33] rounded-xl border border-white/5 faq-item">
              <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-5 text-gray-200 group-open:text-white transition-colors">
                <span>Rule / Global / Direct 有什么区别？</span>
                <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180 text-gray-500"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></span>
              </summary>
              <div class="text-gray-400 text-sm p-5 pt-0 leading-relaxed border-t border-white/5 mt-2 faq-answer">
                <strong>Rule (规则)</strong>：智能分流，国内网站直连，国外网站走代理，推荐日常使用。<br/>
                <strong>Global (全局)</strong>：所有流量强制走代理节点，常用于特定网站在规则中未命中，或需要隐藏原生 IP 时。<br/>
                <strong>Direct (直连)</strong>：所有流量不走代理，相当于关闭翻墙。
              </div>
            </details>
            <details class="group bg-[#131F33] rounded-xl border border-white/5 faq-item">
              <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-5 text-gray-200 group-open:text-white transition-colors">
                <span>TUN Mode (虚拟网卡) 要不要开？</span>
                <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180 text-gray-500"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></span>
              </summary>
              <div class="text-gray-400 text-sm p-5 pt-0 leading-relaxed border-t border-white/5 mt-2 faq-answer">
                日常看网页、看视频不需要开启。当你在玩外服游戏、使用命令行工具 (Terminal)，或发现某些国产软件无视系统代理时，开启 TUN 模式可以强制接管电脑的所有网络流量。
              </div>
            </details>
            <div class="mt-4">
              <a href="/clash-airport" class="text-sm text-breeze-cyan hover:underline">查看更多关于 Clash 机场的专项指南 →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 节点与线路 -->
        <div id="cat-node" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-2 h-8 bg-purple-500 rounded-full inline-block"></span> 节点与线路问题
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <details class="group bg-[#131F33] rounded-xl border border-white/5 faq-item">
              <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-5 text-gray-200 group-open:text-white transition-colors">
                <span>为什么不同节点的延迟不一样？</span>
                <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180 text-gray-500"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></span>
              </summary>
              <div class="text-gray-400 text-sm p-5 pt-0 leading-relaxed border-t border-white/5 mt-2 faq-answer">
                物理距离决定了光信号传输的时间。通常香港/日本节点因为离大陆近，延迟在 30-70ms 左右；美国节点由于跨越太平洋，延迟在 130ms 以上是正常现象，但这并不影响看高清视频的流畅度。
              </div>
            </details>
            <details class="group bg-[#131F33] rounded-xl border border-white/5 faq-item">
              <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-5 text-gray-200 group-open:text-white transition-colors">
                <span>节点倍率是什么意思？</span>
                <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180 text-gray-500"><svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></span>
              </summary>
              <div class="text-gray-400 text-sm p-5 pt-0 leading-relaxed border-t border-white/5 mt-2 faq-answer">
                由于专线（如 IPLC/IEPL）成本极其高昂，部分节点会有倍率设定。例如 2.0 倍率意味着你在这个节点上消耗 1GB 的实际流量，将会在你的套餐中扣除 2GB 的额度。
              </div>
            </details>
            <div class="mt-4">
              <a href="/dedicated-line" class="text-sm text-purple-400 hover:underline">深入了解 IPLC/IEPL 与低延迟线路区别 →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 场景帮助卡片 -->
    <section class="py-16 px-4 bg-[#0B1628]/50 border-y border-white/5">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-8 text-center">特定使用场景指南</h2>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#131F33] to-[#1a2033] p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-700">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">我想看 YouTube / Netflix</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4">流媒体有区域限制和 IP 黑名单机制。</p>
            <ul class="text-sm text-gray-500 space-y-2 list-disc pl-5">
              <li>确保选择原生解锁该地区的节点（如美国、新加坡）。</li>
              <li>如果提示无法观看，尝试清除浏览器缓存或开启浏览器的无痕模式。</li>
              <li>检查客户端是否在“Rule”模式下，且没有被国产杀毒软件拦截。</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#131F33] to-[#152e2a] p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-700">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">我想使用 ChatGPT / Claude</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4">AI 服务对 IP 的纯净度要求极高。</p>
